form,  if } (a\\w b)^2<0 \\text{ and }\n \\text{a and b lie in the \
plane}\\quad \\hat{\\cB}=\\frac{a\\w b}{|a\\w b|} \\\\&\nab={|a|}\\, \
{|b|}\\ee^{\\varphi\\,\\hat{\\cB}} &\\text{rotor form, if } (a\\w b)^2<0 \
\\\\&\n\\hat{a}\\hat{b}=\\ee^{\\varphi\\,\\hat{a}\\w\\hat{b}}=\\ee^{\\varphi\\\
,\\hat{a}\\hat{b}}\n&\\text{rotor form},\\quad \\hat{b}\\perp\\hat{a},\\ \
\\hat{a}^2=\\hat{b}^2=1\\\\&\n  \\widetilde{ab}=ba &\\text{action of \
reversion}\\\\&\n\\gradeinverse{ab}=ab &\\text{action of grade \
inversion}\\\\&\n  \\mathrm{abs}(\\magnitude{ab})= \
\\mathrm{abs}(\\magnitude{a})\\mathrm{abs}(\\magnitude{b}) &\\text{magnitude \
of product of vectors}\\\\&\n\\langle ab\\rangle_0 = a\\d b&\\text{scalar \
part}\\\\&\nab=a\\d b &\\text{if a and b are parallel and pointing in the \
same direction}\\\\&\nab=a\\w b &\\text{if a and b are perpendicular,} \
a\\perp b\\\\&\n    \\mathrm{abs}(\\magnitude{ab})=(\\mathrm{abs}(a\\d \
b)^2+\\mathrm{abs}(\\magnitude{a\\w b}^2))^{\\frac{1}{2}})} \\qquad\\qquad&\n \
    \\text{magnitude  (with abs) of two vector GP product, valid  only \
for}\\cl{p}{0} \\text{and }\\cl{0}{q}\\\\&\nabc\\dots & \\text{versor (GP of \
two or more vectors)}\\\\\n\\end{aligned}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
