Cell[TextData[{
 "All results, after expansion coincides. Conclusion. All these methods  were \
implemented in hope to expand products of MV as fast as possible and in \
general your should not change the default method. If expansion takes long we \
recommend first to convert initial expression into internal Mathematica \
Association format, then expand and convert result back to plain form (since ",
 StyleBox["gaAssociationRepresentation[ ]",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " is not convenient for manual input of basis elements and because many \
package functions can\[CloseCurlyQuote]t handle that internal \
representation). "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"211ef7fc-3488-4462-ad41-21a166f267a5"],

