product of vectors} \\\\&\n a\\d b = \\frac{1}{2}(ab+ba)&  \\text{definition \
of inner (dot) product}\\\\&\n a\\d b=b\\d a & \\text{inner vector product is \
symmetric} \\\\&\n a\\d b=b a & \\text{if vectors are parallel,}\\quad a\\| b\
\\\\&\n a\\d b=0 & \\text{if vectors are perpendicular,}\\quad a\\perp b  \
\\\\&\n a\\d b={|a|}{|b|}\\cos\\theta &\\text{theta is an  angle between the  \
