b}=\\mathrm{abs}(a\\d b) & \\text{magnitude}\\\\&\n a\\d \
\\hat{b}=|a|\\cos\\theta &\\text{scalar projection of a onto  unit \
vector}\\quad \\hat{b}\\\\&\n( a\\d b)b^{-1}=|a|\\cos\\theta\\,\\hat{b} \
\\qquad\\qquad &\\text{projection of vector a onto b}\\\\&\n  a\\d \
b=\\sum_{i=1}^na_ib_i\\e{i}^2 &\\text{inner product in coordinates,}\\quad \
\\e{i}^2=\\pm 1\\\\&a\\d b=\\frac{1}{4}(|a+b|^2-|a-b|^2) &\\text{Polarization \
identity}\n\\end{aligned}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
