\\text{general bivector expansion in basis bivectors},\\\\&\n&b_{ij} \
\\quad\\text{are scalar coefficients}, n=p+q\\\\&\n  \
\\cB^2\\equiv\\cB\\cB&\\text{square of bivector is a scalar iff } \\cB \
\\text{ is the blade}\\\\&\n  \\cB^2=0&\\text{isotropic bivector}\\\\&\n\
\\reverse{\\cB}=-\\cB &\\text{reverse of bivector}\\\\&\n  \
\\gradeinverse{\\cB}=\\cB &\\text{grade inverse of bivector}\\\\&\n \
