Cell["\<\
Define algebra and orthonormal basis. Since we were not satisfied with the \
automatically chosen color, we specified it manually. Bivectors will be \
denoted by script capital letters (can input as \[EscapeKey]sc A\[EscapeKey] )\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"99cd90d7-64e2-4f96-bd6a-019f4e786772"],

