Cell["\<\
In the expanded form  it is (note that  the factor 1/2, which is \
characteristic of  geometric algebra commutators, was added,)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.674978110615829*^9, 3.674978140285064*^9}, {
  3.683185698538377*^9, 3.683185712015132*^9}, {3.68318574576676*^9, 
